2
00:00:01,906 --> 00:00:05,804
It felt so unfair.

3
00:00:05,804 --> 00:00:09,774
One fleeting moment, and misfortune
swallowed me whole.

4
00:00:09,774 --> 00:00:13,840
Yet, again and again...

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,242
Huu.

7
00:00:17,242 --> 00:00:21,092
...I'm made to feel as if I was born only
to suffer.

8
00:00:21,092 --> 00:00:24,558
Haa...

9
00:00:24,558 --> 00:00:28,024
Haa...

10
00:00:28,024 --> 00:00:31,226
...The wind stirs...
